<div type="edition" xml:lang="tam-Latn" rendition="class:vaṭṭeḻuttu maturity:83215">
	
	<p>
		<lb n="1"/>kō-vicaiya
		<lb n="2" break="no"/>may<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ē</reg></choice>ntira-parumaṟku
		<lb n="3"/>mu-p-pattu naṅk-āvatu	
	</p>
	
	<p>
		vāṇa-kō
		<lb n="4" break="no"/>-Araicaru maru-makkaḷ poṟṟokkai
		<lb n="5" break="no"/>-<choice><orig>Ā</orig><reg>yā</reg></choice>r Iḷa-makaṉ karun-tēva-k-katti ta<choice><orig>ṉ
		<lb n="6" break="no" style="text-align: right"/> ṉ</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> erumai-p
		<lb n="7" break="no" style="text-align: right"/>-puṟattē vā
		<lb n="8" break="no" style="text-align: right"/>ṭi-p paṭṭā		
		<lb n="9" break="no" style="text-align: right"/>ṉ kal
			</p>
	         </div>

         <div type="apparatus">

         	<listApp>
         		<app loc="3">
         			<lem>mu-p-pattu naṅk-āvatu</lem>
         			<note><ptr target="bib:IAR1971-1972"/> reads "fifty-fourth".</note>
         		</app>    
         		<app loc="7">
         			<lem>vā<lb n="8" break="no"/>ṭi-p paṭṭā<lb n="9" break="no"/>ṉ</lem>
         			<rdg source="bib:Nakacami1972_01">vā<lb n="8" break="no"/>ṭi paṭṭā<lb n="9" break="no"/>ṉ</rdg>
         		</app>
         		<!--Display issue on line numbers: the 3 numbers appear-->
         		
         	</listApp>

         </div>

      	<div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
      		
      		<p n="1-3">Tirthy-fourth <supplied reason="subaudible">year</supplied> of the victorious king Mayintiraparumaṉ.<note>Sanskrit Mahendravarman.</note></p>
      		
      		<p n="3-9"><supplied reason="subaudible">This is</supplied> the stone <supplied reason="subaudible">of</supplied> Karuntēvakkatti, the younger son <supplied reason="subaudible">of</supplied> Poṟṟokkaiyār, the nephew of the royal Bāṇa king, he who fell and died <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>vāṭi</foreign></supplied> in the buffalo shed <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>erumaippuṟam</foreign><note>See <ptr target="bib:IAR1971-1972"/> <!--Display issue: siglum is not displayed-->for this meaning.</note></supplied>    			
      		</p>
      		
      	</div>


<div type="commentary">
         	<p>See DHARMA_INSPallava00527 <!--update cross-ref--> for the label of the dog represented on the same slab.</p>
         </div>

